# Agent loop

The loop is Strands (`Agent`, `@tool`, `OpenAIModel`). Do not add LangChain, LangGraph, CrewAI, or LiteLLM.

- One `OpenAIModel` per endpoint. Ollama and OpenRouter differ by `MODEL_*` / `FALLBACK_*` URL, key, and model name. `ModelRouter` fails over only when fallback env is set.
- Tools are `@tool` functions in the app. Catalog and duration stay in `apps/workout_album/`.
- Final output is a Pydantic model (`structured_output_model`). One request builds a new `Agent` (no memory across runs).
- CLI may stream and print `trace_lines`. `POST /runs` stays silent and returns `AlbumPick`.
